fense, Defense and Utility.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1232100/extras/7a55449f929d67b10cc3feec81531b7a.avif?t=1725007277\" /></div><br><br>Each playthrough will have a unique string identifier that determines the generated content. Share this seed with your friends so they can experience the same crazy combos and hardships that you did!",
